    <body>
      <p source="#source-253-330"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-253-268"><rb>澄</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-268-280">ちゃん、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280-295"><rb>澄</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-295-330">ちゃん、なにあげよう。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-330-386"><seg source="#source-330-339">あのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339-354"><rb>星</rb><rt>ほし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-354-386">さま、とっておくれ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-386-442"><seg source="#source-386-398">あんまり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-398-413"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-413-442">くて、とれません。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-442-494"><seg source="#source-442-494">そんなら、あたいがとってみよう。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-494-571"><seg source="#source-494-497">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497-512"><rb>星</rb><rt>ほし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-512-524">さま、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-524-539"><rb>星</rb><rt>ほし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-539-571">さま、なにあげよう。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-571-624"><seg source="#source-571-595">のどがかわいた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-595-610"><rb>水</rb><rt>みず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-610-624">おくれ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-624-683"><seg source="#source-624-636">あんまり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636-651"><rb>遠</rb><rt>とお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-651-683">くて、いかれません。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-683-740"><seg source="#source-683-710">そんなら、わたしが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-710-722"><rb>下</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-722-740">りていこう。</seg></p>
    </body>
